
SDLC(Software Development life cycle):

--> this process is used to develop software step by step  in organizes way

1. Requirement : 
--> collect the project requirements from client
--> Understand the application what the application should do

2. planning : 
-->decide the project plan , scope , budget , time and resources

3. Design : 
--> create Ui design , system architectur and decide the database

4. Development : 
--> Developers will write the code build frountend and backend

5. Testing : 
--> testers will test the application for bugs/errors

6. Deployment :
--> Release the application to users/server

7. Maintenance :
--> Fix the bugs and update the features after relase


Browser Engine :

--> it wil convert Html , css and javascript in to a webpage visible to users

Working of Browser Engine 

1. Browser reads html
2. creates DOM tree
3. Reads css and creates CSSOM 
4. combines DOM + CSSOM -> Render tree
5. layout caluclation
6. prints webpage on screen 

DOM(Document Object Model)

-->Dom is a tree structure representation of html document 

javascript uses DOM to :
 -->Access elements
 -->Modify content
 -->Change Styles
 -->Add/remove elements


